0 // Original digital prototype. No physical build, acoustic test, or hardware run.
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub 45601 and one medium angular motor 45603.
0 // Three rotors at 0 / 90 / 180 degrees. Forward lift-and-release direction only.
0 // Y downward. 20 LDU per stud. Full inventory counts the hub and motor as assemblies.
0 // Flexible motor lead omitted. Hub is a separate bench console.
0 // Use the illustrated guide and parts_list.csv alongside this multipart model.
0 // Flattened form; see MPD for named subassemblies.
